Phase 5 has syntax debugger, tag completion, indentation assistance and customizable templates."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n2le03ob04aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "code snippets "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " small parts of source code that can be reused"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Programmer's Notepad comes with an editor to create code snippets, and you can adapt it to personal needs by using add-ons."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n2le03ob04aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "interface "}, {"type": "definition", "content": " a system where it is possible to manage all the commands and devices that are available in a computer program  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: SynWrite has basic functionalities as syntax highlighting and code folding, and programmers can improve the interface with plugins from Python."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n2le03ob04aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "extension  "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a file that has additional information to complete the data and functionalities of another program "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sublime Text 2 supports a lot of computer languages, and you can optimize its performance with extension aids from Package control."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "enpe8n2le03ob04aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "<strong>There Is / There Are in Negative Statements</strong>"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "In order to express the idea of the existence of something both in singular and plural forms, the English language combines the word <strong>there</strong> and the Verb To <strong>Be</strong>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "To make the negative form of there is and there are, only add the word <span class= \"strong\">not </span>  or <span class= \"strong\">no </span>  after the <span class= \"strong\">verb to be</span>. You use <span class= \"strong\">no </span>  before nouns and certain adjectives, and <span class= \"strong\">not </span> before certain determiners. <br><br> Example: <br><br> <span class= \"italic\"> There is <span class= \"strong\">no </span>   place like this.<br> There is <span class= \"strong\">not </span>  a difference between them. </span><br>  You can conjugate the <span class= \"strong\">verb to be</span> and contract it as <span class= \"strong\">isn't</span>.  or <span class= \"strong\">aren't</span>.  Some examples are: <br><br> <span class= \"italic\"> \t<span class= \"strong\"> There isn't</span>  anything better as a functional HTML editor. <br> <span class= \"strong\">There aren't</span>  many differences between paid and free editors. </span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><strong>Negative Forms</strong></p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><strong>There is - present singular form</strong></p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">There is not + noun (singular)</p> <p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">There isn&rsquo;t&nbsp;&nbsp; + noun (singular)</p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><strong>There are- present plural form</strong></p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">There are not + noun (plural)</p> <p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">There aren&rsquo;t&nbsp;&nbsp; + noun (plural)</p>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "There is no problem; let's review it together. Ok, what can web developers do with HTML editors?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Yes, there are many options, but there is not any free editor that offers the full functionality of paid editors.  "}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Modal Verb Can for Possibility in Affirmative Statements"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<p>We use the modal <strong>can</strong> in English to express the possibility of something happening.</p>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Ok, what can web developers do with HTML editors?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "These computer programs can provide developers with different functionalities for editing web pages"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<p>It&rsquo;s possible to make use of the modal <strong>can </strong>to talk about features for free HTML editors in affirmative statements.&nbsp;</p> <p>Possibility:&nbsp;</p> <ul> <li><span class=\"italic\">An HTML editor <strong>can</strong> offer many services to web developers.</span></li> <li><span class=\"italic\">Free HTML editors <strong>can</strong> be available online.&nbsp;</span></li> </ul>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><strong>Affirmative sentences</strong></p>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><strong>Subject</strong></p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><strong>Modal verb</strong></p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><strong>Main verb</strong></p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><strong>Complement</strong></p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: right;\\\"><span class=\\\"italic\\\">An HTML editor</span></p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span class=\\\"italic\\\">can</span></p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span class=\\\"italic\\\">offer</span></p>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><span class=\\\"italic\\\">many services to web developers.</span></p>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\"\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look for information about a free HTML editor."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Design a brochure to show the advantages of that HTML editor. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use technical vocabulary."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present your brochure to your class."}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I look for information about a free HTML editor."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I design a brochure."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I present my brochure to my class."}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n2le03ob04re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "enpe8n2le03ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<span class= \"strong\">Kim</span>: Hey, Nick. What are you doing?<br>\n<span class= \"strong\">Nick</span>: I'm preparing an oral presentation about HTML editors for Mr. Sanders' class. Is there any problem if I ask you to give me a hand with some of these questions? <br>\n<span class= \"strong\">Kim</span>: There is no problem; let's review it together. Ok, what can web developers do with HTML editors? <br>\n<span class= \"strong\">Nick</span>: Web developers use HTML editors to create websites; these computer programs can provide developers with different functionalities for editing web pages. <br>"}, {"time": "33000", "image": "enpe8n2le03ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kim</span>: What features does an HTML editor need?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Nick</span>: Autocompletion and code highlighting are two essential services in simple editors. There is no good editor without these two functions; however, some editors can offer extra features to help developers. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kim</span>: Are HTML editors available for free?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Nick</span>: Yes, there are many options, but there is not any free editor that offers the full functionality of paid editors.  The main difference is that paid versions get frequently updated; they can include a better color scheme, and users can upload data directly to a server. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kim</span>: Which are some free HTML editors for Windows? <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Nick</span>: There are editors like Phase 5, Programmer's Notepad, SynWrite, PlainEdit. Net, Notepad++ or Sublime Text 2. <br>"}, {"time": "92000", "image": "enpe8n2le03ob04re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class= \"strong\">Kim</span>: What are some features of free HTML editors for Windows? <br>\n<span class= \"strong\">Nick</span>: Phase 5 has syntax debugger, tag completion, indentation assistance and customizable templates. It runs with different versions of Windows operating systems and servers. Programmer's Notepad comes with an editor to create code snippets, and you can adapt it to personal needs by using add-ons. <br>\n<span class= \"strong\">Kim</span>: What about SynWrite and Sublime Text 2?  <br>\n<span class= \"strong\">Nick</span>: SynWrite has basic functionalities as syntax highlighting and code folding, and programmers can improve the interface with plugins from Python. Sublime Text 2 is one of the best options for beginners. It supports a lot of computer languages, and you can optimize its performance with extension aids from Package control. <br>\n<span class= \"strong\">Kim</span>: Perfect, Nick. There is not any problem with the information you have! <br>"}], "coverimg": "enpe8n2le03ob04re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "_data": [], "id": 1, "title": ""}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about the need for an HTML editor to develop a website. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can list some free HTML editors for Windows. "}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can discuss a few characteristics for some free HTML editors."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What do you need to create a website?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What type of computer languages are used to design websites?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Welcome"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "You have 2 tries"}, {"type": "text", "content": "you have 1 attempt left"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "try again"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"type": "free_header_text", "content": "Ask your partner:"}, {"type": "free_type_text_area", "content": "What do you know about free HTML editors?"}], "id": 0, "img_path": ""}, {"stimuli_ids": [1], "template_override": 1, "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 0, "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1, "id": 1}], "id": 0}], "type": "